{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And Pharaoh was wrathful against his two officers.</b> Our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: the Holy One, blessed be He, grew wrathful against a king on account of his servants, to deliver the righteous man — and they counted Yosef; and the Holy One, blessed be He, grew wrathful against two servants on account of King Ahasuerus, to deliver the righteous man — and they counted Mordecai."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:18:56.615064097Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}